---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const assetUrl = "https://wte.wiki/og/wtewiki/default-v1.jpg";
---

<BaseLayout title="Open Graph assets" description="Stable Open Graph image assets for the WhyTrashEarth network.">
  <section class="content" aria-labelledby="og-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Shared infrastructure</p>
    <h1 id="og-title">Open Graph assets</h1>
    <p class="intro">WTE Wiki can host durable, public preview images for the WhyTrashEarth network. Other WTE sites may reference the absolute image URLs below in their own metadata.</p>

    <article class="card p-24 asset">
      <img src="/og/wtewiki/default-v1.jpg" width="1200" height="630" alt="WTE Wiki Open Graph image" />
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">WTE Wiki default</p>
        <h2>Version 1</h2>
        <code>{assetUrl}</code>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Format</dt><dd>JPEG</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Dimensions</dt><dd>1200 × 630</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Use</dt><dd>Absolute URL in <code>og:image</code> and <code>twitter:image</code></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="guidance" aria-labelledby="guidance-title">
      <h2 id="guidance-title">Keeping links reliable</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the versioned URL exactly as shown; it will not be overwritten with a different image.</li>
        <li>New artwork gets a new versioned filename, while existing asset URLs remain available.</li>
        <li>Keep social-preview images public, served over HTTPS, and at 1200 × 630 whenever possible.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The current inventory is also available as <a href="/og/manifest.json">JSON</a> for maintainers and future tooling.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .asset { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .asset img { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: .5rem; height: auto; }
  code { overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: .9rem; }
  dl { display: grid; gap: .65rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; }
  dl div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); padding-top: .65rem; }
  dt { color: var(--color-muted); } dd { margin: 0; }
  .guidance { margin-top: 3rem; }
</style>
